Description: Provides a preprocessing and quality-control pipeline for eye
    tracking data, standardizing raw gaze and event exports from multiple
    eye tracker manufacturers onto a common column schema before computing
    per-file and per-sample data quality metrics. Device-specific import
    logic is implemented through a pluggable adapter/registry system, so
    support for a new eye tracker is added by registering a new adapter
    rather than modifying the core pipeline; adapters for Tobii Studio and
    Tobii Pro exports are included. The pipeline performs eye selection,
    blink classification, gaze smoothing and interpolation, and off-screen
    sample removal, and can generate diagnostic plots and summary reports
    for individual files or for batches of files organized in a BIDS-like
    directory structure.
